# Phyrexian Dragon Engine is discarded to Faithless Looting and unearthed on turn 9 for {3}{R}{R} (CR 702.84a): a sorcery-speed
# activated ability that works from the graveyard. It returns with haste, and its "enters from your graveyard" trigger
# lets Bot1 discard their hand and draw three. It attacks the turn it returns, and double strike makes 2 damage into 4.
# At the beginning of the next end step unearth exiles it, so it never comes back to the graveyard.

